# Diamond story 22-maylene-cobble-badge: standalone start (--lab, or no end save from 21-route210-215-veilstone-dawn).
# Standard header + lab party + the cumulative state after 21-route210-215-veilstone-dawn, then the milestone's start.
# Applied on top of the D/P new-game base save; names resolve through tests/gameplay/labc.py --game diamond;
# flag/var lines cite the script that sets them.
name GQ
gender PLAYER_GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 31415
money 20000
# Standard lab party: Surf in slot 0 and slots 1-3 cleared, so an empty Surf falls back to Struggle
# instead of stalling A-only battles. Maylene (trdata.json #317): MEDITITE 27, MACHOKE 27, LUCARIO 30 — Surf from
# EMPOLEON 60 KOs each (Lucario's Drain Punch / Force Palm are neutral on Water/Steel). Black Belts (trdata.json
# #309 #310 #311 #312): MACHOKE/MACHOP/MEDITITE lv 25-28, one Surf each.
party SPECIES_EMPOLEON 60 ITEM_NONE
party-move 0 0 MOVE_SURF
party-move 0 1 MOVE_NONE
party-move 0 2 MOVE_NONE
party-move 0 3 MOVE_NONE
party SPECIES_STARAPTOR 50 ITEM_NONE
party-move 1 0 MOVE_AERIAL_ACE
party-move 1 1 MOVE_ROCK_SMASH
party-move 1 2 MOVE_CUT
# @@PRIOR@@
# -- start --
warp MAP_VEILSTONE_GYM 0  # (12,25), zone_event 0132 warp 0 (Veilstone gym door zone_event 0131 warp 13 (684,611))
